# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4106
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_d536175f:

    # girl.char "After his men had ample time to leer and jeer, he told me to get on all fours."
    girl.char "他的部下们有足够的时间对我冷笑和嘲笑之后，他命令我四肢着地。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4108
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_019fc387:

    # girl.char "Again, I had no choice."
    girl.char "我别无选择。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4110
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_745f9add:

    # girl.char "That's when he brought forward his favorite horse..."
    girl.char "这时，他牵来了他最喜欢的马……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4112
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_96a70992:

    # you "Oh."
    you "哦。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4114
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_7b693942:

    # "She blushes and lowers her eyes."
    "She blushes and lowers her eyes."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4116
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_5178ed47:

    # girl.char "He told me... To pleasure his horse, in front of everyone... Or he would slit my throat."
    girl.char "他告诉我……要我当着所有人的面取悦他的马……否则他就要割断我的喉咙。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4118
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_b4ed34b8:

    # girl.char "I was weak... I didn't want to die..."
    girl.char "我当时很虚弱……我不想死……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4120
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_8bb00932:

    # you "I see..."
    you "我懂了..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4122
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_98ddf7e1:

    # "She starts crying uncontrollably. You decide to give her a break."
    "She starts crying uncontrollably. You decide to give her a break."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4131
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_c7383372:

    # "You find [girl.name] laying on her bed, looking silently at the ceiling."
    "You find [girl.name] laying on her bed, looking silently at the ceiling."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4133
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_12508aa3:

    # "Even though she noticed your presence, she doesn't move from her position. She starts talking absent-mindedly."
    "Even though she noticed your presence, she doesn't move from her position. She starts talking absent-mindedly."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4135
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_5cb74dbd:

    # girl.char "When I was a prisoner, in the hills, I used to look at the skies all night... I wondered if I could fly away, like a bird, and escape from this pain and madness."
    girl.char "当我还是囚犯，被囚禁在山里时，我常常整夜仰望天空……我常常想，我是否可以像鸟儿一样飞走，逃离这痛苦和疯狂。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4137
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_40bb0b24:

    # you "But you escaped, eventually. How did you do it?"
    you "但你最终还是逃脱了。你是怎么做到的？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4139
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_8235cf51:

    # "She looks sad."
    "She looks sad."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4141
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_2444a762:

    # girl.char "After the incident with the [girl.story_profession]'s horse, everyone at the camp started bullying me."
    girl.char "在[girl.story_profession]的马发生那件事之后，营地里的每个人都开始欺负我。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4143
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_562149bd:

    # girl.char "Even the other captives were calling me a slut, and a horsefucker. I was the loneliest soul in the world."
    girl.char "就连其他俘虏都骂我是荡妇、是人兽交者。我是世界上最孤独的人。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4145
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_38bcd874:

    # girl.char "At some point... I decided to end my life."
    girl.char "在某个时刻……我决定结束自己的生命。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4147
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_3e26844e:

    # you "Oh..."
    you "哦..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4149
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_f63a794e:

    # girl.char "Other captives started complaining that they didn't want to be chained with... the horsefucker. It got so bad that the bandits decided to just make me walk in front of the party all day, while they took turns mocking and abusing me."
    girl.char "其他俘虏开始抱怨说他们不想和……那个操马的家伙一起被锁在一起。情况越来越糟，强盗们干脆让我整天站在队伍前面，轮流嘲笑和虐待我。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4151
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_15ac8cb2:

    # girl.char "One day, we were walking along a cliff overlooking a wide river. I decided this was my chance to end it."
    girl.char "有一天，我们沿着俯瞰宽阔河流的悬崖散步。我决定这是结束这一切的机会。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4153
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_441cfb4a:

    # girl.char "Before anyone could react, I ran up to the edge and leapt down. I heard some curses and screams, the rush of wind, and then the water hit me like a wall and everything went blank."
    girl.char "还没等任何人反应过来，我就跑到边缘纵身跃下。我听到几声咒骂和尖叫，一阵风吹过，然后水像一堵墙一样撞在我身上，我眼前一黑，什么都看不见了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4156
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_85cd7df8:

    # girl.char "Before I jumped, I had decided to end my life... But when I got back to my senses, I was scared senseless. I broke my bonds with a strength I didn't know I had, and I swam against the current to reach the other side."
    girl.char "跳下去之前，我已决定结束自己的生命……但当我恢复意识时，却吓得魂飞魄散。我用一种自己都未曾意识到的力量挣脱了束缚，逆流而上，游向了彼岸。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4159
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_08516455:

    # girl.char "I was weak... My body wouldn't let me die."
    girl.char "我当时很虚弱……我的身体不让我死。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4161
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_79ea25ff:

    # you "Then... What happened?"
    you "然后……发生了什么？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4164
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_9fa446ca:

    # girl.char "I escaped and met a caravan of pilgrims, on their way to Zan... They took pity on me, and brought me to the city. That's where I met you."
    girl.char "我逃了出来，遇到了一支前往赞恩的朝圣商队……他们可怜我，把我带到了城里。在那里，我遇见了你。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4167
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_69244085:

    # girl.char "A caravan found me by the side of the road, when I was nearly starving... I had no clothes on my back, not a denar to my name... They decided to brand me a slave, and there was nothing I could do. It was destiny..."
    girl.char "我饿得奄奄一息时，被一支商队发现倒在路边……我身无分文，一分钱也没有……他们决定把我烙上奴隶的印记，我无力反抗。这就是命运……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4170
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我懂了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4172
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_ecfca602:

    # girl.char "So many things have happened since, but I can't forget about that nightmare... Sometimes, it keeps me awake at night, reliving through the terror of it all."
    girl.char "此后发生了很多事，但我始终无法忘记那场噩梦……有时，它会让我夜不能寐，让我一次次重温那场噩梦带来的恐惧。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4174
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_ecc9aa85:

    # you "Is there something I can do to help?"
    you "我能做些什么来帮忙吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4176
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_1bf4dbfc:

    # girl.char "Well... I don't know if I should ask..."
    girl.char "嗯……我不知道该不该问……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4178
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_74d26893:

    # you "Try me."
    you "试试看。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4180
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_63f8834f:

    # girl.char "There is one thing I would really like..."
    girl.char "我真的很想要一件事……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4183
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_30a0e246:

    # girl.char "You might not believe me, but... The night I... played with the horse, in front of everyone..."
    girl.char "你可能不相信我，但是……那天晚上，我……当着所有人的面和那匹马玩耍……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4184
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_544f27dc:

    # girl.char "I can't get it out of my mind. It was so intense..."
    girl.char "我一直忘不了那件事。那感觉太强烈了……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4185
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_86b9e2f9:

    # girl.char "Whenever I think about it, I get so wet... I wish I had another chance... To do it in public with a stallion, with all eyes on me..."
    girl.char "每次想到这件事，我都湿透了……我真希望还有一次机会……在众目睽睽之下，和一匹种马做爱，让所有人的目光都集中在我身上……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4190
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_1720783e:

    # girl.char "I have learnt that the son of a bitch who led that raiding party is in town right now... Spending the spoils of his misdeeds. If I could, I would kill him myself, but..."
    girl.char "我听说那个带头劫掠的混蛋现在就在城里……正在挥霍他作恶的战利品。如果可以，我真想亲手杀了他，但是……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4191
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_a206a445:

    # girl.char "I'm weak..."
    girl.char "我身体虚弱……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4195
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_d5d87e40:

    # girl.char "It is a strange idea, but hear me out."
    girl.char "这想法很奇怪，但请听我解释。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4196
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_72c1d9a4:

    # girl.char "I just learnt that the son of a bitch who led that raiding party is in town right now..."
    girl.char "我刚刚得知，那个带头发动袭击的混蛋现在就在城里……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4197
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_b9cde491:

    # girl.char "There's nothing he loves more in the world than this horse. And there's nothing I hate more..."
    girl.char "世上他最爱的就是这匹马。而我最恨的就是它……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4198
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_403c6623:

    # girl.char "I want to eat that horse."
    girl.char "我想吃掉那匹马。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4199
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_d94adbdc:

    # you "Whaat?"
    you "什么？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4200
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_17c69e27:

    # girl.char "I know it's strange, but hear me out: if I eat that dumb animal, I can get over my trauma. And I can get my revenge... I just need to find someone who will get that horse for me, and turn it into a steak..."
    girl.char "我知道这很奇怪，但请听我说完：如果我吃了那匹蠢马，我就能克服我的创伤。而且我还能报仇……我只需要找到人帮我弄到那匹马，把它做成牛排……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4201
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_b29f429e:

    # you "Well... That's an odd request..."
    you "嗯……这要求有点奇怪……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4205
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_bf3073f1:

    # girl.char "I can't forget that they left my [girl.story_guardian] to rot in a field, together with the other dead pilgrims... I wish I could offer them a proper burial... Burn their remains in Arios fire..."
    girl.char "我无法忘记他们把我[girl.story_guardian]和其他死去的朝圣者一起丢在田野里腐烂……我多么希望能够为他们举行一个体面的葬礼……将他们的遗骸焚烧在阿瑞俄斯的火焰中……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4207
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_f24fbd54:

    # girl.char "I have looked, and I found a map of where it all happened. But it's remote, and I have no means to go there and take care of it."
    girl.char "我找过了，找到了事发地点的地图。但是那里很偏远，我没有办法去那里处理这件事。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4222
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_86b9e2f9_1:

    # girl.char "Whenever I think about it, I get so wet... I wish I had another chance... To do it in public with a stallion, with all eyes on me..."
    girl.char "每次想到这件事，我都湿透了……我真希望还有一次机会……在众目睽睽之下，和一匹种马做爱，让所有人的目光都集中在我身上……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4227
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_1720783e_1:

    # girl.char "I have learnt that the son of a bitch who led that raiding party is in town right now... Spending the spoils of his misdeeds. If I could, I would kill him myself, but..."
    girl.char "我听说那个带头劫掠的混蛋现在就在城里……正在挥霍他作恶的战利品。如果可以，我真想亲手杀了他，但是……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4231
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_6f5fc28f:

    # girl.char "I want to eat the horse that molested me."
    girl.char "我想吃掉那匹猥亵我的马。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4232
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_d94adbdc_1:

    # you "Whaat?"
    you "什么？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4233
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_17c69e27_1:

    # girl.char "I know it's strange, but hear me out: if I eat that dumb animal, I can get over my trauma. And I can get my revenge... I just need to find someone who will get that horse for me, and turn it into a steak..."
    girl.char "我知道这很奇怪，但请听我说完：如果我吃了那匹蠢马，我就能克服我的创伤。而且我还能报仇……我只需要找到人帮我弄到那匹马，把它做成牛排……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4237
translate chinese_simplified slave_story3_bf3073f1_1:

    # girl.char "I can't forget that they left my [girl.story_guardian] to rot in a field, together with the other dead pilgrims... I wish I could offer them a proper burial... Burn their remains in Arios fire..."
    girl.char "我无法忘记他们把我[girl.story_guardian]和其他死去的朝圣者一起丢在田野里腐烂……我多么希望能够为他们举行一个体面的葬礼……将他们的遗骸焚烧在阿瑞俄斯的火焰中……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4251
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_361f1993:

    # "You find [girl.name] standing in front of the mirror, admiring a small night dress she bought for herself with her allowance."
    "You find [girl.name] standing in front of the mirror, admiring a small night dress she bought for herself with her allowance."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4255
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_151763ef:

    # "She buries her face in the fabric, taking in the smell of the new dress."
    "She buries her face in the fabric, taking in the smell of the new dress."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4257
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_f263b05e:

    # "When she lifts back her face, she is startled to see your reflection in the mirror."
    "When she lifts back her face, she is startled to see your reflection in the mirror."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4261
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_076984e2:

    # girl.char "Oh!"
    girl.char "哦！"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4263
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_44bab695:

    # you "Hi, [girl.name]... Am I interrupting something?"
    you "你好，[girl.name]……我打扰到你们了吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4265
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_32c32369:

    # "She looks embarrassed."
    "She looks embarrassed."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4267
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_e9692be3:

    # girl.char "No, Master..."
    girl.char "不，主人……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4269
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_3ef61008:

    # you "That's a nice little dress you have there."
    you "你那件小裙子真漂亮。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4272
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_2cf53156:

    # you "I'm sure it looks good on you."
    you "我相信它很适合你。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4274
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_4c9271d9:

    # "Your eyes narrow."
    "Your eyes narrow."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4275
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_6ca15cd6:

    # you "It must have been costly. Living the good life, aren't you?"
    you "这肯定花了不少钱。过好日子啊，不是吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4277
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_b6d367bd:

    # you "Well, as long as it's your money..."
    you "只要是你自己花的钱就行……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4279
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_d34f0608:

    # girl.char "I... I got it for cheap..."
    girl.char "我……我买得很便宜……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4281
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_c028f9e0:

    # girl.char "I never got to enjoy this kind of luxury when I was a child..."
    girl.char "我小时候从来没享受过这种奢华的生活……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4283
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_1b43fbf6:

    # you "Is that so?"
    you "是这样吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4286
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_b6fe2914:

    # girl.char "Yes... I was born in [girl.origin], in a very poor family..."
    girl.char "是的……我出生在[girl.origin]，一个非常贫困的家庭……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4288
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_4680cb4f:

    # girl.char "Yes, I was born a slave... My [girl.story_guardian] too..."
    girl.char "是的，我生来就是奴隶……我的[girl.story_guardian]也是……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4296
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_a3b1a43a:

    # girl.char "But I wasn't having much fun..."
    girl.char "但我玩得并不开心……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4298
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_258c9fbb:

    # girl.char "We were servants. We lived in [girl.story_home_article], doing hard chores for our masters..."
    girl.char "我们是佣人。我们住在[girl.story_home_article]，为主人做繁重的家务……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4300
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_33148a27:

    # girl.char "My earliest memories are of orders being barked, and the cracking of the whip... It wasn't nice."
    girl.char "我最早的记忆是听到命令被大声呵斥，听到鞭子抽打的声音……那可不是什么美好的回忆。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4302
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我懂了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4304
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_22dc23eb:

    # girl.char "I rarely caught a break, but when I did, I used to sit by the side of the main road, watching travelers come and go."
    girl.char "我很少能休息，但休息的时候，我常常坐在大路边，看着过往的旅客来来往往。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4306
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_eb86dd87:

    # girl.char "One day... I must have been 7 or 8... I saw a noble lady ride down the road. Most nobles ride in carriages, so I rarely had a chance to see one up close, but that lady was very brazen."
    girl.char "有一天……我当时大概七八岁……我看到一位贵妇人乘马车沿着路走来。大多数贵族都乘坐马车，所以我很少有机会近距离看到马车，但那位贵妇人非常大胆。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4308
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_91be91f5:

    # girl.char "She had the most sublime, amazing outfit I had ever seen... Red, flamboyant, with silk ribbons and silver and gold ornaments. I was dumbstruck."
    girl.char "她穿着我见过的最华丽、最惊艳的服装……鲜艳夺目，缀满了丝带和金银饰品。我简直惊呆了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4310
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_513f7cc8:

    # girl.char "Ever since, I have loved pretty dresses..."
    girl.char "从那时起，我就爱上了漂亮的裙子……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4312
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_397e68e9:

    # you "Well, work hard, and you just might get your own, one day..."
    you "只要努力，说不定有一天你也能拥有属于自己的家……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4314
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_4e8eeb14:

    # girl.char "Yes, Master [MC.name]..."
    girl.char "是的，主人[MC.name]……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4325
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_f8088ea1:

    # "You find [girl.name] at her desk, drawing something. It looks like some kind of garment. She slips it under a book as soon as she realizes your presence."
    "You find [girl.name] at her desk, drawing something. It looks like some kind of garment. She slips it under a book as soon as she realizes your presence."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4327
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_6533823a:

    # girl.char "Oh, Master [MC.name], hello!"
    girl.char "哦，[MC.name] 主人，您好！"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4329
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_4ad489aa:

    # you "Hi, [girl.name]."
    you "你好，[girl.name]。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4331
