    girl.char "这是一个很傻的梦……但我会……我会买属于自己的裙子……我设计了这么久……我会很漂亮……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4527
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_4836eef5_1:

    # girl.char "I never want to feel so weak, ever again... For that, I need money... This is the only thing that can make a difference for a lowly slave like me."
    girl.char "我再也不想感到如此软弱无力了……为此，我需要钱……对于像我这样卑微的奴隶来说，只有钱才能改变现状。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4528
translate chinese_simplified slave_story4_51682f98_1:

    # girl.char "If you would allow me to save some more money out of my allowance, I would be more secure..."
    girl.char "如果你允许我从零花钱里多存点钱，我会更有安全感……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4542
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_de76043b:

    # "As you enter [girl.name]'s room, you are surprised to find it empty."
    "As you enter [girl.name]'s room, you are surprised to find it empty."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4545
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_50c7ad8f:

    # "Immediately, you start feeling worried. After all, [girl.name] tried to run away recently."
    "Immediately, you start feeling worried. After all, [girl.name] tried to run away recently."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4548
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_a0bd681a:

    # "You don't think [girl.name] would run away on you, but you still feel worried."
    "You don't think [girl.name] would run away on you, but you still feel worried."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4550
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_e86f4161:

    # "You are about to move back to the corridor and tell Sill [girl.name] is missing, when you hear some noise coming from outside."
    "You are about to move back to the corridor and tell Sill [girl.name] is missing, when you hear some noise coming from outside."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4554
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_6c513c51:

    # "The window creaks open, and you are surprised to see [girl.name] sneak in, oblivious to your presence."
    "The window creaks open, and you are surprised to see [girl.name] sneak in, oblivious to your presence."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4556
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_1f8d7728:

    # you "Ahem-hem."
    you "咳咳。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4560
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_363ccb90:

    # "She is shocked to see you standing there. She starts mumbling."
    "She is shocked to see you standing there. She starts mumbling."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4562
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_d6194184:

    # girl.char "Master! I, uh, I was just going for some fresh air, I swear..."
    girl.char "主人！我，呃，我只是想出去透透气，我发誓……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4570
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_2119dbe3:

    # you "Is that so... Why do I feel like there's more to it?"
    you "真是这样吗……为什么我总觉得事情还有隐情？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4575
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_af3c345d:

    # you "Are you fucking kidding me! You are forbidden to leave this room without permission, understand?"
    you "你他妈在开玩笑吗！未经允许，你不准离开这个房间，明白吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4577
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_1c7a94aa:

    # "She looks chastised."
    "She looks chastised."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4579
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_10f603c4:

    # girl.char "I'm sorry..."
    girl.char "对不起..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4581
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_2325727f:

    # girl.char "I haven't been able to cope with the feeling of being locked in... Not since..."
    girl.char "我一直无法忍受被困住的感觉……自从……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4584
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_7af00b8e:

    # you "Who gives a fuck about what you can or cannot cope with, slave? Will ten lashes help you 'cope'?"
    you "谁他妈在乎你能应付什么或不能应付什么，奴隶？挨十鞭子就能让你“应付”了吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4585
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_397b0de4:

    # girl.char "Oh, Master, no!"
    girl.char "哦，主人，不要！"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4587
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_96773a44:

    # you "Since what?"
    you "从什么时候开始？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4589
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_f5103810:

    # girl.char "I just... I was in prison before, you see. It was a terrible, terrible time."
    girl.char "我只是……你知道，我以前坐过牢。那是一段非常非常可怕的时光。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4591
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_fef91995:

    # you "Have you, now? For what?"
    you "现在有了？为了什么？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4593
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_7ce7c857:

    # girl.char "It all started while I was living in [girl.origin] with my [girl.story_guardian]."
    girl.char "这一切都始于我和我的[girl.story_guardian]住在[girl.origin]的时候。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4600
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_54e6d272:

    # girl.char "We were living together in [girl.story_home_article]... Life was easy then."
    girl.char "我们当时一起住在[girl.story_home_article]... 那时生活很轻松。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4602
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_a87859b5:

    # girl.char "We weren't very well off, so we sometimes accommodated travellers for the night for a few denars... There weren't many inns in the remote neighborhood where we lived."
    girl.char "我们当时家境并不富裕，所以有时会收几个第纳尔让旅客留宿一晚……我们居住的偏僻街区里没有多少旅店。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4604
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_f3970f70:

    # girl.char "I was happy that way, but I could tell something frustrated my [girl.story_guardian]..."
    girl.char "我当时很高兴，但我能感觉到我的[girl.story_guardian]有些事情让她感到沮丧……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4606
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_cb1988a5:

    # girl.char "Kept saying, 'If we had more money, we could move to a rich area, and live the high life', stuff like that..."
    girl.char "他总是说，“如果我们更有钱，我们就可以搬到富人区，过上奢华的生活”，诸如此类的话……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4608
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_b7e720e7:

    # girl.char "That's about the time my [girl.story_guardian] decided robbing travellers would be better money than hosting them."
    girl.char "就在那时，我的[girl.story_guardian]决定抢劫旅行者比接待他们赚钱更多。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4610
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_96a70992:

    # you "Oh."
    you "哦。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4612
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_25e23f39:

    # girl.char "As you can imagine, things didn't go down so well..."
    girl.char "可想而知，事情进展得并不顺利……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4614
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_fc99e269:

    # girl.char "But look at the time, we must get ready for tonight's opening... I'm sorry to keep you, Master [MC.name]."
    girl.char "但是看看时间，我们必须为今晚的开幕式做准备……很抱歉耽误您了，[MC.name] 主人。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4616
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3c7ec6d4:

    # you "Hmm."
    you "唔。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4625
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_baec7f36:

    # "You find [girl.name] pacing around impatiently in her room."
    "You find [girl.name] pacing around impatiently in her room."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4627
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_fc93ed0c:

    # you "What's eating you, [girl.name]?"
    you "[girl.name]，你有什么心事吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4629
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_2c0dc8b2:

    # girl.char "Oh, Master [MC.name]..."
    girl.char "哦，主人[MC.name]……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4632
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_88e7601a:

    # girl.char "Thanks for coming... I appreciate the company."
    girl.char "谢谢光临……我很享受有你们陪伴。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4634
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_7c920f22:

    # girl.char "I was thinking by myself... It's hard to talk sometimes..."
    girl.char "我独自思考着……有时候很难开口说话……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4636
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3b74b67c:

    # girl.char "I was thinking about the story I told you last time... Of how I ended up in a jail..."
    girl.char "我一直在想上次跟你讲的那个故事……关于我怎么进了监狱的那个故事……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4638
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_5329c274:

    # you "Right. You haven't told me the rest of that story."
    you "没错。你还没告诉我故事的其余部分。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4640
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_c6fd2935:

    # girl.char "You remember my [girl.story_guardian] came up with a scheme to rob travellers that came to the [girl.story_home]?"
    girl.char "你还记得我的[girl.story_guardian]想出了一个抢劫来[girl.story_home]的旅客的计划吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4642
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_adc030f2:

    # girl.char "It was a fairly simple scheme. I was told to act as bait. I didn't want to go against my [girl.story_guardian], so I went along with it."
    girl.char "这是一个相当简单的计划。他们让我充当诱饵。我不想违背我的[girl.story_guardian]的意愿，所以就照做了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4644
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_1f9617fe:

    # girl.char "I was barely 16 or 17, and in my prime... Most men lusted after me."
    girl.char "我当时才十六七岁，正值青春年华……大多数男人都对我垂涎三尺。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4646
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_1150e5c2:

    # girl.char "My part was to seduce the single men that came by our guesthouse... I'd drink a few rounds with them, then offered them to skip out and take a little walk by the moonlight."
    girl.char "我的职责是勾引光顾我们旅馆的单身男士……我会和他们喝几轮酒，然后邀请他们出去在月光下散散步。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4649
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_f081bd16:

    # girl.char "Of course, they didn't know their drinks were spiked... Once outside, I'd lead them towards a quiet spot near the river... There, my [girl.story_guardian] would ambush them, beating them up and stealing their belongings. Because they were drugged, they couldn't put up a big fight."
    girl.char "当然，他们并不知道饮料里被下了药……到了外面，我会把他们引到河边一个僻静的地方……在那里，我的[girl.story_guardian]会伏击他们，把他们揍一顿，抢走他们的财物。因为他们被下了药，所以根本无力反抗。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4652
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_c08b646e:

    # girl.char "Once they were passed out, we carried them back to the [girl.story_home]. The next day, we'd tell them they got into a fight outside with some strangers, and we found them lying in the gutter without their purse. Usually they'd thank us, and be on their way, not too sure about what really happened."
    girl.char "等她们昏过去之后，我们就把她们抬回[girl.story_home]。第二天，我们会告诉她们，她们在外面和陌生人打架了，我们发现她们躺在路边的排水沟里，钱包也不见了。她们通常会道谢，然后就走了，不太清楚到底发生了什么。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4655
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_bce97211:

    # girl.char "But..."
    girl.char "但..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4657
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_e9cb16c3:

    # girl.char "It all went to hell one day."
    girl.char "有一天，一切都彻底崩坏了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4659
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3900c296:

    # you "What happened?"
    you "发生了什么？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4661
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3d87271d:

    # girl.char "One night, our guest was a mean looking man from the West, [girl.story_profession_article], I think... He was scarred and ugly, I didn't want anything to do with him..."
    girl.char "一天晚上，我们来了一位客人，是个长相凶恶的西部男人，[girl.story_profession_article]，我想……他满脸伤疤，相貌丑陋，我不想和他有任何瓜葛……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4664
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_ce55e789:

    # girl.char "I tried to talk my [girl.story_guardian] into skipping that one, but to no avail. The [girl.story_profession] carried around a heavy bag, which looked loaded with valuables, and greed proved stronger."
    girl.char "我试图劝我的[girl.story_guardian]跳过那件事，但无济于事。那个[girl.story_profession]拎着一个沉甸甸的包，看起来装满了贵重物品，而贪婪最终战胜了一切。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4667
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_804411a6:

    # girl.char "So I tried my usual routine with the stranger, and it worked all right... After we had a few rounds, I started running my hand across his crotch, and whispered to him: 'follow me...'"
    girl.char "于是我照例对这个陌生人做了几轮，效果还不错……几轮过后，我开始用手抚摸他的胯部，并低声对他说：“跟我来……”"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4669
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_887db267:

    # girl.char "We went outside by the back door, and I took his hand and led him towards the river..."
    girl.char "我们从后门出去，我牵着他的手，领着他走向河边……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4671
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_d7ee04be:

    # girl.char "We were making out, and he started fondling me under my blouse... I was disgusted to have an old, ugly man touch me in such a way, but it was also oddly exciting..."
    girl.char "我们当时正在亲热，他开始隔着我的衬衫抚摸我……一个又老又丑的男人这样碰我，我感到恶心，但同时又觉得有点刺激……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4673
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_fd39bb7f:

    # girl.char "As usual, my [girl.story_guardian] arrived wearing a mask and wielding a heavy sap."
    girl.char "和往常一样，我的[girl.story_guardian]戴着面具，挥舞着沉重的树液瓶出现了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4675
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_4d6049ee:

    # girl.char "Drugged as he was, the [girl.story_profession] couldn't see it coming. But to our surprise, he didn't fall with the first blow."
    girl.char "尽管他当时神志不清，[girl.story_profession] 还是没能预料到这一幕。但出乎我们意料的是，他并没有在第一击中就倒下。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4677
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3d9893be:

    # girl.char "He stumbled away from me, and started swearing. My [girl.story_guardian] went after him, but he had some kind of fighting training. His combat reflexes seemed to have kicked in."
    girl.char "他踉跄着离开我，开始咒骂。我的[girl.story_guardian]追了上去，但他似乎受过某种格斗训练，他的战斗本能好像立刻就被激发出来了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4680
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_4d5232d5:

    # girl.char "In spite of the drugs running through his system, the [girl.story_profession] put up a fierce fight. My [girl.story_guardian] started to panic... And took out a knife."
    girl.char "尽管他体内有毒品，[girl.story_profession] 还是进行了顽强的反抗。我的[girl.story_guardian] 开始惊慌失措……然后掏出了一把刀。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4682
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_ea99acad:

    # girl.char "Before I could do anything, my [girl.story_guardian] stabbed the old guy. Once, then twice, then half-a-dozen times."
    girl.char "还没等我反应过来，我的[girl.story_guardian]就捅了那个老头一刀。一刀，两刀，然后又捅了六刀。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4684
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_4d84418d:

    # girl.char "When I ran to my [girl.story_guardian] and tried to stop this madness, it was too late. The [girl.story_profession] was stone-cold dead."
    girl.char "当我跑到我的[girl.story_guardian]身边试图阻止这场疯狂时，一切都太迟了。[girl.story_profession]已经冰冷地死去了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4686
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_8756e0fa:

    # you "Wow..."
    you "哇..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4688
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_52654763:

    # girl.char "Once we realised what we'd just done, we started to completely panic. We thought we had to get rid of the body first, so we dragged it to the river."
    girl.char "当我们意识到自己刚才做了什么之后，我们彻底慌了。我们觉得必须先处理掉尸体，于是就把它拖到了河边。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4690
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_84f9b249:

    # girl.char "After we disposed of the body, my [girl.story_guardian] opened the heavy bag that the [girl.story_profession] was travelling with. It was filled with jewels."
    girl.char "处理完尸体后，我的[girl.story_guardian]打开了[girl.story_profession]随身携带的沉重行李袋。里面装满了珠宝。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4692
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_40bc22d8:

    # you "Really?"
    you "真的吗？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4694
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_87763c13:

    # girl.char "My [girl.story_guardian] got so excited, forgetting instantly about we had just done... I didn't know what to think."
    girl.char "我的[girl.story_guardian]兴奋极了，瞬间忘记了我们刚刚做过的事……我不知道该怎么想。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4696
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_e4722677:

    # girl.char "But we had no time to celebrate, anyway... Because as we were contemplating the spoils of our crime, a guard patrol showed up."
    girl.char "但我们根本没时间庆祝……因为正当我们琢磨着犯罪所得的时候，一队巡逻的卫兵出现了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4698
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_3e26844e:

    # you "Oh..."
    you "哦..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4700
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_a8888bbd:

    # "[girl.name] looks restless and tired."
    "[girl.name] looks restless and tired."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4702
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_95549195:

    # girl.char "I will tell you the rest later... It's a painful story to me."
    girl.char "剩下的事以后再说……对我来说，那是一段痛苦的经历。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4704
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_b0ecb5e5:

    # you "I see."
    you "我懂了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4713
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_d6ad4b86:

    # "You find [girl.name] by the window, contemplating the streets outside."
    "You find [girl.name] by the window, contemplating the streets outside."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4715
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_aa46bdbd:

    # girl.char "Hi, Master [MC.name]..."
    girl.char "您好，[MC.name]大师……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4717
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_5a777dc3:

    # you "Hi, [girl.name]... You're not thinking of sneaking out on me again, are you?"
    you "嗨，[girl.name]……你不会又想偷偷溜出去吧？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4719
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_23ef2a8a:

    # girl.char "N... No..."
    girl.char "不……不……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4721
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_40f3547c:

    # girl.char "I was in prison for 13 months..."
    girl.char "我在监狱里待了13个月……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4723
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_b22b7c6a:

    # you "For killing the [girl.story_profession] you told me about?"
    you "因为你杀了你跟我说过的那个[girl.story_profession]？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4725
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_44036fd9:

    # girl.char "For being an accessory to the crime..."
    girl.char "因为是犯罪的从犯……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4727
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_8855dd4c:

    # you "The guard patrol arrested you and your [girl.story_guardian]?"
    you "巡逻队逮捕了你和你的[girl.story_guardian]？"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4729
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_152df13e:

    # girl.char "Oh... They did worse than that."
    girl.char "哦……他们做得比这更糟。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4731
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_297da782:

    # girl.char "When the patrol arrived, we were busy counting the jewels, my [girl.story_guardian] was still covered with the [girl.story_profession]'s blood..."
    girl.char "巡逻队到达时，我们正在清点珠宝，我的[girl.story_guardian]身上还沾着[girl.story_profession]的血……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4733
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_e2973082:

    # you "It must have been hard to explain..."
    you "这一定很难解释……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4735
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_7023e094:

    # girl.char "Yes. We made up some stories, but the guards wouldn't have any of it. That's when my [girl.story_guardian] offered to strike them a deal."
    girl.char "是的。我们编了一些故事，但守卫们根本不相信。这时我的[girl.story_guardian]提出可以和他们做个交易。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:4737
translate chinese_simplified slave_story5_8fece875:

