    girl.char "空气中弥漫着死亡和焦木的气味……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5418
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_96381874:

    # girl.char "In the middle of the plaza also stood my [girl.story_guardian]. It was the first time we were together again after many days of suffering."
    girl.char "广场中央也站着我的[girl.story_guardian]。这是我们经历了多日的苦难后第一次重聚。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5420
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_9db9ba3b:

    # girl.char "I got a knot in my stomach, I knew something wasn't right."
    girl.char "我感觉胃里一阵翻腾，我知道肯定出了什么事。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5422
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_cbd0f186:

    # girl.char "A crowd gathered, and the inquisitor started his speech. He went on about enemies of the one true religion..."
    girl.char "人群聚集起来，审判官开始了他的演讲。他滔滔不绝地讲述着唯一真宗教的敌人……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5424
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_c17d306d:

    # girl.char "Then he said that we were here that day to witness the burning of evil, and possibly redemption... It was deeply unsettling. I didn't understand why anything had to burn."
    girl.char "然后他说，我们今天来到这里是为了见证邪恶的焚毁，或许还有救赎……这让我感到非常不安。我不明白为什么一定要有什么东西被焚毁。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5426
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_4aa6b02e:

    # girl.char "As he kept talking, it dawned on me. My [girl.story_guardian] hadn't renounced our god. They were going to burn my [girl.story_guardian] at the stake."
    girl.char "他继续说下去，我突然明白了。我的[girl.story_guardian]并没有背弃我们的神。他们要把我的[girl.story_guardian]绑在火刑柱上烧死。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5428
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_3e26844e:

    # you "Oh..."
    you "哦..."

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5430
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_3ddc8cdf:

