    girl.char "但情况变得更糟了。审判官转向我，用威胁的语气问我是否放弃我的假神，重新皈依唯一真正的信仰。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5432
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_c5fdebb9:

    # girl.char "I was terribly scared, so I said yes."
    girl.char "我当时非常害怕，所以就答应了。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5434
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_3938a451:

    # girl.char "He then asked me if I would prove my loyalty to Arios, by publicly accusing the ones responsible for my 'indoctrination'..."
    girl.char "然后他问我是否愿意公开指控那些对我进行“洗脑”的人，以此来证明我对阿里奥斯的忠诚……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5436
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_5b4e5efd:

    # girl.char "And then I understood what he meant. He wanted me to denounce my own [girl.story_guardian]."
    girl.char "然后我明白了他的意思。他想让我谴责我自己的[girl.story_guardian]。"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5438
