    girl.char "我当时又哭又懵，迷失了方向，彻底迷失了……我向我的[girl.story_guardian]求助，绝望地寻求帮助……"

# game/BKinteractions.rpy:5440
translate chinese_simplified slave_story7_4dc5a941:

